<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-10489] Web console: validation messages are shown twice in configuration</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10489</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;What happens:&lt;br/&gt;
When validation is triggered for any form in configuration, &lt;em&gt;two&lt;/em&gt; validation messages are shown simultaneously: one under the input and another in tooltip.&lt;br/&gt;
 &lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12950136/12950136_image-2018-11-30-14-59-19-188.png&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;What should happen:&lt;br/&gt;
Tooltip-style validation messages should not be visible on configuration screens.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The issues is caused by &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9811&quot; title=&quot;Web Console: Do not block &amp;quot;Save&amp;quot; button in case some inputs are invalid&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-9811&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-9811&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
